  "ingredients": [
    "1 head cauliflower, cut into florets",
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "1 clove garlic, smashed",
    "0.25 cup grated Parmesan cheese",
    "1 tablespoon reduced-fat cream cheese",
    "0.5 teaspoon kosher salt",
    "0.125 teaspoon freshly ground black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Place a steamer insert into a saucepan; fill with water until just below bottom of the steamer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IUvACeBSBpgYTHLqoE0v9X5KzLc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-230816-garlic-mashed-cauliflower--ddmfs-step-01-1-9236280e03fe48928ac3cbe096ca3e6c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230816/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring water to a boil; add cauliflower, cover, and steam until tender, about 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-Xl9AkMssZsvgXx1jyOXWvM46gA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-230816-garlic-mashed-cauliflower--ddmfs-step-03-1-1747ea7feff048f98b91a2ba6fcac366.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230816/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, heat olive oil in a small skillet over medium heat. Add garlic; cook and stir until softened, about 2 minutes. Remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_2k6XWhEREyc_sfABjGTh4_fn1k=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-230816-garlic-mashed-cauliflower--ddmfs-step-04-1-e754d24ef3194b4a80e4ba548e3041ef.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230816/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer ½ cauliflower to the bowl of a food processor; cover and process on high.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qR9xsg4yAGlC67P26a0v1PB12vc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-230816-garlic-mashed-cauliflower--ddmfs-step-05-1-f97e8159d9aa415d8d9402dc7d480c3c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230816/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Blend in remaining cauliflower florets, one at a time, until creamy. Blend in cooked garlic, Parmesan cheese, cream cheese, salt, and black pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nCU2qWH4aXVaqwmWLhM0_AkqMX4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-230816-garlic-mashed-cauliflower--ddmfs-step-06-1-b3b7c89105344b5aba9e773789caa709.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/230816/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QmUDzd2P3kBNr55iYL81ZYfqB6M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-230816-garlic-mashed-cauliflower--ddmfs-beauty-4x3-3f202b981a66409fa684ce21af94e73e.jpg"
